      "source": "thm-separated-uniformity-iff-induced-topology-is-hausdorff",
      "source_section": "Statement",
      "quote": "The topology induced by a uniformity $\\mathcal U$ is Hausdorff if and only if $\\mathcal U$ is separated.",
      "uses": [
        "4.1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fact": "L5",
